'''''Phragmipedium caudatum''''', commonly called the '''Mandarin orchid''', is a species of [[orchid]] occurring from [[Peru]] to [[Bolivia]].<ref name=iucn/> It is the [[type species]] of the genus ''[[Phragmipedium]]''.

